              "content": "A common skin concern caused by various factors including genetics, age and excess sebum production. While it is not possible to completely get rid of enlarged pores, there are many ways to reduce their appearance with proper skincare and makeup application."
            }
          },
          "e17f20fd-04d6-4b73-860c-0a668c65df21": {
