              "product-1": "quick-cover-stick",
              "product-content-1": "Instantly covers and minimizes the appearance of dark spots with a natural skin-like finish.",
              "product-2": "tinted-hydrator",
              "product-content-2": "Blurs and minimizes imperfections like dark spots and scars, and evens skin tone. Niacinamide helps brighten the complexion.",
              "product-3": "",
              "product-content-3": "",
              "product-4": "",
              "product-content-4": "",
              "v-url": "",
              "content": "Also called hyperpigmentation, dark spots on the skin are caused by an overproduction of melanin, giving them a darker than normal color. Causes include sun exposure, hormones, age, and scarring."
            }
          },
