        "block_order": [
          "77d82cd9-4ad6-4a7e-a3b8-88f82121b6a3",
          "a28fe96e-fcc7-4b7c-a2a4-39ab82ee12c5",
          "7eb1b2d0-ac52-4c57-87b0-7da540c13572",
          "5a36eb05-e75e-43fd-8c14-78f51d18c570"
        ],
        "settings": {
          "sec-head": "WHY WE'RE HERE",
          "content": "<p>Well, we’re honestly here for YOU. Yes, you. An amazing human being with multitudes of diverse layers that wants to look and feel like their favorite, most authentic self. The traditional, mainstream beauty and makeup industry has always focused on femme faces and really underinvested in what self-care and uncomplicated beauty can look like for men. <br/></p><p>Makeup isn’t just for women. The desire to look and feel your best is universal, but the vast majority of makeup products are made for and marketed exclusively to women. That’s been the norm for as long as we can remember. </p><p></p><p>Now we’re creating a NuNorm. We’ve designed a core line of products formulated specifically for male skin, so you don’t need to navigate outdated social norms, judgment, or confusion around traditional cosmetics ever again.</p>"
        }
      },
