      "a-letter-from-our-ceo": {
        "type": "a-letter-from-our-ceo",
        "settings": {
          "sec-head": "a letter from our ceo",
          "content": "<p>We firmly believe that makeup is for everyone, regardless of gender, and we want to change the outdated perception that it is exclusively for women. Our mission is to help men feel confident and empowered by offering high-quality makeup products that cater to their specific needs, and we invite you to step out of your comfort zone and give it a try. We hope to see a future where wearing makeup is <em><strong>nürmalized</strong></em> for all genders, and we are committed to this journey of discovery and transformation.</p>",
          "img": "shopify://shop_images/image_37.png"
        }
      },
