      "our-best-saller": {
        "type": "our-best-saller",
        "blocks": {
          "6d491d7a-a88a-41a7-9e12-46357f9dfc76": {
            "type": "column",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/1.png",
              "title": "1. Shine Eraser",
              "text": "<p>Take the glare down a notch. Our invisible blotting and setting powder is designed to instantly absorb excess oil and sweat, reduce shine and mattify the complexion. Packaged in a discreet, compact slide tin that makes for easy touch ups on the go. <br/></p>",
              "link_label": "Try it now",
              "link": "#"
            }
          },
          "18963cad-22b2-4f9a-8fef-8a25bc1dd947": {
            "type": "column",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/2.png",
              "title": "2. Tinted Hydrator",
              "text": "<p>Looking for a way to even out your skin tone without a lot of fuss? Our tinted hydrator does just that. Our light weight sheer skin tint applies like a refreshing facial lotion that immediately blurs imperfections, evens out your skin tone and provides lasting hydration for a more healthy looking complexion.<br/></p>",
              "link_label": "Try it now",
              "link": "#"
            }
          },
          "68a148ae-d942-4ed4-b3a6-2f33ff5a72d7": {
            "type": "column",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/3.png",
              "title": "3. Quick Cover",
              "text": "<p>Have a good skin day. Our multi-use complexion stick offers lightweight, buildable coverage to instantly conceal and cover blemishes, discoloration and other skin imperfections. Our creamy, flexible formula blends easily and adheres to skin for a natural, soft matte finish. <br/></p>",
              "link_label": "Try it now",
              "link": "#"
            }
          },
          "bfa28bbf-04bd-4d8e-a7de-09a0aa1840e9": {
            "type": "column",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_193.png",
              "title": "4. Brow Tamer",
              "text": "<p>Brows are the key to a put together look. Don’t let yours get out of control! Our invisible clear gel grooms, shapes and sets brows and can be used to tame and hold unruly facial hair while hair care actives help condition hairs and promote stronger, healthier growth over time. <br/></p>",
              "link_label": "Try it now",
              "link": "#"
            }
          }
        },
